summary:
  The bridge obeys SetPosition whatever track the caller names.

history:
  MPRIS hands out a track id with the metadata and wants it back with the
  position, so a call made for a track that has ended can be told from one
  meant for what plays now. The bridge never read it. Run on a private bus on
  2026-11-10: a call naming /Track/999 moved the playing episode like any
  other.

target:
  package/contents/ui/mpris.py

find:
      if not state.get("canSeek") or str(track_id) != playing_track:

replace:
      if not state.get("canSeek"):

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_mpris_setposition.py::test_a_call_for_a_track_that_is_over_moves_nothing.
  Line-neutral.
